":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu$ 见 [[90-df-min-operator-generalized]]；$\\simeq$ 是 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 所引用的部分函数外延相等，$\\circ$ 是 [[90-df-relation]] 的关系图复合。集合推导式中的 $\\frown$、$\\langle y\\rangle$ 是集合论有限列连接和一元列，不是自然数序列码。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"4badec96813b3395","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu$ 见 [[90-df-min-operator-generalized]]；$\\simeq$ 是 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 所引用的部分函数外延相等，$\\circ$ 是 [[90-df-relation]] 的关系图复合。集合推导式中的 $\\frown$、$\\langle y\\rangle$ 是集合论有限列连接和一元列，不是自然数序列码。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 取 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T_k,U,\\Phi_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\ \\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nf\\simeq U\\circ\\left(\\mu\\left\\{\n\\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle y\\rangle:\n\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land y\\in\\mathbb N\\land T_k(e,\\vec x,y)\n\\right\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"f=\\varphi_e^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{k+2}","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":2134,"backlinks":[{"id":"73df8af25850d4b3","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"存在见证取 [[90-lem-program-numbering]] 的具体 $T_k,U$，正向为 [[90-df-kleene-normal-form]]。反向逐个判定 $T(e,\\vec x,0),T(e,\\vec x,1),\\ldots$，找到首个真例后计算 $U$；未找到则运行不终止。这给出所要求部分函数的机器计算。"},{"id":"ccbc0a46c077469a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-number.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-sentence.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system.md]]\n[[90-df-halt-notation.md]]\n[[90-df-haltseq.md]]\n[[90-df-hbl-conditions.md]]\n[[90-df-henkin-sentence.md]]\n[[90-df-hypersimple-set.md]]\n[[90-df-incompletable-extension.md]]\n[[90-df-incompletable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy.md]]\n[[90-df-kleene-normal-form.md]]\n[[90-df-kolmogorov-complexity.md]]\n[[90-df-liar-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-m-complete.md]]\n[[90-df-machine-coding.md]]\n[[90-df-min-operator-generalized.md]]\n[[90-df-min-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-multiplication-function.md